{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">新疆博爾塔拉蒙古自治州精河縣的紅外線相機，近日拍攝到一組珍貴的雪豹家族畫面。鏡頭中一隻成年雪豹帶著三隻幼崽，在白雪覆蓋的山地上悠然漫步。雪豹是國家一級保護動物，被國際自然保護聯盟列為「易危」物種，主要棲息於中亞及南亞的喜馬拉雅山脈地區，海拔介乎2,500至4,500米之間。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"20260716 ANIMAL - 截图2\" src=\"http://outin-63362ff8bc7011f09c8900163e08026a.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/69f903c549ac4e1a902621be559f6bb8/snapshots/8fe0a18377324bf3acb2d0e349edbaac-00002.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"视频 20260716 ANIMAL 的第2张截图\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>雪雞馬鹿北山羊同現　生態鏈趨完善</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">除了雪豹，紅外相機還記錄到多種野生動物，反映當地生態系統日益繁榮。據統計，該林區已發現超過340種野生動物，包括雪雞、馬鹿及北山羊等。近年來當地生態環境持續改善，野生動物種群數量穩步增加。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"20260716 ANIMAL - 截图7\" src=\"http://outin-63362ff8bc7011f09c8900163e08026a.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/69f903c549ac4e1a902621be559f6bb8/snapshots/8fe0a18377324bf3acb2d0e349edbaac-00007.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"视频 20260716 ANIMAL 的第7张截图\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"20260716 ANIMAL - 截图5\" src=\"http://outin-63362ff8bc7011f09c8900163e08026a.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/69f903c549ac4e1a902621be559f6bb8/snapshots/8fe0a18377324bf3acb2d0e349edbaac-00005.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"视频 20260716 ANIMAL 的第5张截图\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"20260716 ANIMAL - 截图6\" src=\"http://outin-63362ff8bc7011f09c8900163e08026a.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/69f903c549ac4e1a902621be559f6bb8/snapshots/8fe0a18377324bf3acb2d0e349edbaac-00006.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"视频 20260716 ANIMAL 的第6张截图\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"20260716 ANIMAL - 截图4\" src=\"http://outin-63362ff8bc7011f09c8900163e08026a.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/69f903c549ac4e1a902621be559f6bb8/snapshots/8fe0a18377324bf3acb2d0e349edbaac-00004.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"视频 20260716 ANIMAL 的第4张截图\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"20260716 ANIMAL - 截图3\" src=\"http://outin-63362ff8bc7011f09c8900163e08026a.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/69f903c549ac4e1a902621be559f6bb8/snapshots/8fe0a18377324bf3acb2d0e349edbaac-00003.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"视频 20260716 ANIMAL 的第3张截图\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-15T23:18:23.692509+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":249,"images":6,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}